   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to increase income of poor families in Sughd and Khatlon regions through micro-business training and development and thereby also contribute towards UNICEF&apos;s goal of de-institutionalising children in pilot institutions in the same areas. Close co-operation between Mercy Corps, the National  Association of Business Women and UNICEF is foreseen.</narrative>
